 DF lists this closure in more than one week\; it's shown here as one event
 .\n\nTfL live status (Planned Closure\, checked 28 November 2026): LONDON 
 UNDERGROUND: Christmas Day\, 25 December\, no service on any line. Service
 s resume on Boxing Day morning to a revised Sunday timetable. No Night Tub
 e services operate on Christmas Eve or Boxing Day.\nTfL live status (Part 
 Closure\, checked 28 November 2026): PICCADILLY LINE: Christmas Eve\, 24 D
 ecember\, no service between Rayners Lane and Uxbridge. Please use METROPO
 LITAN LINE services instead.\nTfL live status (Part Closure\, checked 28 N
 ovember 2026): PICCADILLY LINE: Boxing Day\, 26 December to Sunday 3 Janua
 ry\, no service between Rayners Lane and Uxbridge. Please use METROPOLITAN
  LINE services instead.\n\nSource: TfL planned track closures\, correct at
  Monday 16 November 2026. https://tfl.gov.uk/api/document/plannedtrackclos
 ures.pdf?id=accc98cf-e761-47b3-a43b-3de08a097b8f&type=document\nPlans can 
 change. Check before you travel: https://tfl.gov.uk/tube-dlr-overground/st
 atus/\nPowered by TfL Open Data\nUnofficial calendar\, not produced or end
