 Downs and Cheshunt / Enfield Town. Use London Underground connections betw
 een Central London and Seven Sisters\, and for Rectory Road and Stoke Newi
 ngton\, use Clapton station. Last trains operate at 2245 from Liverpool St
 reet to Cheshunt\, 2300 from Enfield Town to Liverpool Street\, 2253 from 
 Liverpool Street to Enfield Town and 2302 from Cheshunt to Liverpool Stree
 t. Replacement buses operate.\n\nSource: TfL planned track closures\, corr
